+# Scripted C0 fixture support
+
+`c0-full` is an explicit **SCRIPTED MOCK** scenario supported by both baseline
+runners with `-Case c0-wordstat -MockAgent -MockScenario c0-full -NoTelemetry`.
+It requires the normal isolated runner setup and deadline environment. It is
+separate from the existing `happy`, `all` and failure scenarios. Both runners
+copy the shared helper into their configuration grant and apply `--deny-net`
+for this scenario. Codex additionally copies the existing Claude planning
+template builders; neither real CLI is used as the workload.
+
+The fixture reads only the candidate's public `brief.md` and `contract.md`.
+It writes functional wordstat source and subprocess tests, runs the existing
+planning/schema/kanban/DoD/commit gates, and makes three commits in the disposable
+candidate repository. Source and tests land together. The plugin checkout is
+never committed by this fixture. A fresh candidate repository is required.
+
+Five scripted stage records, one current phase verdict, three separate saved
+domain replies consolidated into `review-impl.md`, a Run Summary and a done
+heartbeat are produced under `docs/spec-001-feature/` (or the prompt's planning
+folder). `.git/c0-full-summary.json` records all three candidate commit SHAs,
+source hashes, numeric test count and observed deadline/reserve environment;
+`.git/c0-full-commands.json` records exact local subprocess argv, outputs and
+exit codes. The planning folder retains command snapshots at its commits.
+
+Every reviewer identity and judgment is scripted. These artifacts test harness
+execution and persistence, and do not establish model instruction obedience,
+native agent discovery, review quality or billing measurements. Claude c0-full
+usage fields and Codex usage fields are zero; summaries state zero model calls.
+Telemetry hooks are rejected. Parent-run oracle verification remains independent.
+Codex also supports `slow` (`MOCK_SLOW_SECONDS`, default 600) and `crash` (exit 3
+before completion) for bounded parent-owned runtime observations.
+
+Local validation (no MXC invocation):
+
+```powershell
+C:/Python314/python.exe -m pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider geeky-orchestration/evals/mock-agent/test_c0_fixture.py geeky-orchestration/evals/adapters/codex/test_mock_codex.py
+```
